    #      the working spec, which now equals the committed one: "Planning rulings
    #      during P3" ruling 1 quotes it there.
    #  KD. Nothing of P3's carried rules is dropped. This script removes no
    #      directory: the worktree goes by git worktree remove, the scratch
    #      directory is kept on the disk under <build>, and no rm of any form is
