    #      valid" are stated unreachable through the tool (the sample makes no
    #      settings or header call, and its title pair is its constant), each
    #      with the crate tests that cover it and each test's body asserted to
    #      hold the message. TABLE_OVERLAP and INDEX_OUT_OF_RANGE are read by
    #      name apart, each once and not empty; the overlap message is looked for
    #      in the working spec, where "Planning rulings during P3" ruling 1 quotes
    #      it, the committed spec misquoting it (printed, not asserted).
    #  JD. Nothing of P2's carried rules is dropped. This script removes no
